  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The akasha within you coats your bones and infuses your muscles, making you more resilient.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you take this feat, you gain 2 hit points for each akashic feat you have. Whenever you take a new akashic feat, you gain 2 more hit points. If you are using the death by massive damage rules, you gain a +4 bonus on Fortitude saves made to avoid death from massive damage.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
